[{"id":"aqsama-81-15-1","words":["verb:aqsama"],"options":[{"bs":"kunem se","en":"I swear"},{"bs":"zakleli ste se","en":"you (all) swore"},{"bs":"zakleli su se","en":"they swore"},{"bs":"zaklinjete se","en":"you (all) swear"}],"ref":"81:15","answerWord":"أُقْسِمُ","answerSound":"audio/b7e4b18b6bd294efc6e5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Oh, but I call to witness the planets,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zakleti se","en":"to swear"},"passage":["فَلَآ","أُقْسِمُ","بِٱلْخُنَّسِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَقْسَمَ"}},{"id":"aqsama-6-109-0","words":["verb:aqsama"],"options":[{"bs":"i zakleli su se","en":"and they swore"},{"bs":"zakleli ste se","en":"you (all) swore"},{"bs":"kunem se","en":"I swear"},{"bs":"zaklinjete se","en":"you (all) swear"}],"ref":"6:109","answerWord":"وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a5c11553dcef1b2768a1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they swear a solemn oath by Allah that if there come unto them a portent they will believe therein. Say; Portents are with Allah and (so is) that which telleth you that if such came unto them they would not believe.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zakleti se","en":"to swear"},"passage":["وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","جَهْدَ","أَيْمَٰنِهِمْ","لَئِن","جَآءَتْهُمْ","ءَايَةٌ","لَّيُؤْمِنُنَّ","بِهَا","قُلْ","إِنَّمَا","ٱلْءَايَٰتُ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَمَا","يُشْعِرُكُمْ","أَنَّهَآ","إِذَا","جَآءَتْ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَقْسَمَ"}},{"id":"aqsama-68-17-7","words":["verb:aqsama"],"options":[{"bs":"zakleli su se","en":"they swore"},{"bs":"zaklinje se","en":"he/it swears"},{"bs":"zakleli ste se","en":"you (all) swore"},{"bs":"zaklinjete se","en":"you (all) swear"}],"ref":"68:17","answerWord":"أَقْسَمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/d4a04e7e2989c2619c80.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We have tried them as We tried the owners of the garden when they vowed that they would pluck its fruit next morning,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zakleti se","en":"to swear"},"passage":["إِنَّا","بَلَوْنَٰهُمْ","كَمَا","بَلَوْنَآ","أَصْحَٰبَ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ","إِذْ","أَقْسَمُوا۟","لَيَصْرِمُنَّهَا","مُصْبِحِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَقْسَمَ"}},{"id":"aqsama-7-49-2","words":["verb:aqsama"],"options":[{"bs":"zakleli ste se","en":"you (all) swore"},{"bs":"kunem se","en":"I swear"},{"bs":"zaklinje se","en":"he/it swears"},{"bs":"zakleli su se","en":"they swore"}],"ref":"7:49","answerWord":"أَقْسَمْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/bc2ffc9f7bceecef09ea.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Are these they of whom ye swore that Allah would not show them mercy? (Unto them it hath been said): Enter the Garden. No fear shall come upon you nor is it ye who will grieve.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zakleti se","en":"to swear"},"passage":["أَهَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَقْسَمْتُمْ","لَا","يَنَالُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","بِرَحْمَةٍ","ٱدْخُلُوا۟","ٱلْجَنَّةَ","لَا","خَوْفٌ","عَلَيْكُمْ","وَلَآ","أَنتُمْ","تَحْزَنُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَقْسَمَ"}},{"id":"aqsama-14-44-19","words":["verb:aqsama"],"options":[{"bs":"zakleli ste se","en":"you (all) swore"},{"bs":"zaklinje se","en":"he/it swears"},{"bs":"zaklinjete se","en":"you (all) swear"},{"bs":"zakleli su se","en":"they swore"}],"ref":"14:44","answerWord":"أَقْسَمْتُم","answerSound":"audio/05f5fb8523209cdc0a6e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And warn mankind of a day when the doom will come upon them, and those who did wrong will say: Our Lord! Reprieve us for a little while. We will obey Thy call and will follow the messengers. (It will be answered): Did ye not swear before that there would be no end for you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zakleti se","en":"to swear"},"passage":["وَأَنذِرِ","ٱلنَّاسَ","يَوْمَ","يَأْتِيهِمُ","ٱلْعَذَابُ","فَيَقُولُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوا۟","رَبَّنَآ","أَخِّرْنَآ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","قَرِيبٍ","نُّجِبْ","دَعْوَتَكَ","وَنَتَّبِعِ","ٱلرُّسُلَ","أَوَلَمْ","تَكُونُوٓا۟","أَقْسَمْتُم","مِّن","قَبْلُ","مَا","لَكُم","مِّن","زَوَالٍ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"أَقْسَمَ"}},{"id":"aqsama-24-53-9","words":["verb:aqsama"],"options":[{"bs":"zaklinjete se","en":"you (all) swear"},{"bs":"pa se zaklinju","en":"so they (two) swear"},{"bs":"zakleli ste se","en":"you (all) swore"},{"bs":"zakleli su se","en":"they swore"}],"ref":"24:53","answerWord":"تُقْسِمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/c32765828f5a3610c989.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They swear by Allah solemnly that, if thou order them, they will go forth. Say: Swear not; known obedience (is better). Lo! Allah is Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zakleti se","en":"to swear"},"passage":["وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","جَهْدَ","أَيْمَٰنِهِمْ","لَئِنْ","أَمَرْتَهُمْ","لَيَخْرُجُنَّ","قُل","لَّا","تُقْسِمُوا۟","طَاعَةٌ","مَّعْرُوفَةٌ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","خَبِيرٌۢ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَقْسَمَ"}},{"id":"aqsama-30-55-3","words":["verb:aqsama"],"options":[{"bs":"zaklinje se","en":"he/it swears"},{"bs":"kunem se","en":"I swear"},{"bs":"zaklinjete se","en":"you (all) swear"},{"bs":"pa se zaklinju","en":"so they (two) swear"}],"ref":"30:55","answerWord":"يُقْسِمُ","answerSound":"audio/9cd4fd35fbb12783aa26.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And on the day when the Hour riseth the guilty will vow that they did tarry but an hour - thus were they ever deceived.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zakleti se","en":"to swear"},"passage":["وَيَوْمَ","تَقُومُ","ٱلسَّاعَةُ","يُقْسِمُ","ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","مَا","لَبِثُوا۟","غَيْرَ","سَاعَةٍ","كَذَٰلِكَ","كَانُوا۟","يُؤْفَكُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَقْسَمَ"}},{"id":"fassala-7-174-1","words":["verb:fassala"],"options":[{"bs":"potanko izlažemo","en":"We detail"},{"bs":"objasnio je potanko","en":"he/it explained in detail"},{"bs":"objasnili smo ga potanko","en":"we explained it in detail"},{"bs":"objašnjava potanko","en":"he/it explains in detail"}],"ref":"7:174","answerWord":"نُفَصِّلُ","answerSound":"audio/572d49fc32f80f2287ce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus we detail the revelations, that haply they may return.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potanko objasniti","en":"to explain in detail"},"passage":["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","نُفَصِّلُ","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","وَلَعَلَّهُمْ","يَرْجِعُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"فَصَّلَ"}},{"id":"fassala-6-126-5","words":["verb:fassala"],"options":[{"bs":"potanko smo izložili","en":"We have detailed"},{"bs":"i objašnjavamo potanko","en":"and we explain in detail"},{"bs":"objašnjava potanko","en":"he/it explains in detail"},{"bs":"objašnjeno je potanko","en":"it was explained in detail"}],"ref":"6:126","answerWord":"فَصَّلْنَا","answerSound":"audio/b840e1945b7c8e70b79a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"This is the path of thy Lord, a straight path. We have detailed Our revelations for a people who take heed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potanko objasniti","en":"to explain in detail"},"passage":["وَهَٰذَا","صِرَٰطُ","رَبِّكَ","مُسْتَقِيمًا","قَدْ","فَصَّلْنَا","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","لِقَوْمٍ","يَذَّكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"فَصَّلَ"}},{"id":"fassala-11-1-5","words":["verb:fassala"],"options":[{"bs":"objašnjeno je potanko","en":"it was explained in detail"},{"bs":"potanko izlažemo","en":"We detail"},{"bs":"objasnio je potanko","en":"he/it explained in detail"},{"bs":"objašnjava potanko","en":"he/it explains in detail"}],"ref":"11:1","answerWord":"فُصِّلَتْ","answerSound":"audio/8912c981e73c12aac978.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Alif. Lam. Ra. (This is) a Scripture the revelations whereof are perfected and then expounded. (It cometh) from One Wise, Informed,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potanko objasniti","en":"to explain in detail"},"passage":["الٓر","كِتَٰبٌ","أُحْكِمَتْ","ءَايَٰتُهُۥ","ثُمَّ","فُصِّلَتْ","مِن","لَّدُنْ","حَكِيمٍ","خَبِيرٍ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"فَصَّلَ"}},{"id":"fassala-7-52-3","words":["verb:fassala"],"options":[{"bs":"objasnili smo ga potanko","en":"we explained it in detail"},{"bs":"potanko izlažemo","en":"We detail"},{"bs":"objašnjava potanko","en":"he/it explains in detail"},{"bs":"objašnjeno je potanko","en":"it was explained in detail"}],"ref":"7:52","answerWord":"فَصَّلْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/d239f3188b4b8866c282.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Verily We have brought them a Scripture which We expounded with knowledge, a guidance and a mercy for a people who believe.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potanko objasniti","en":"to explain in detail"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","جِئْنَٰهُم","بِكِتَٰبٍ","فَصَّلْنَٰهُ","عَلَىٰ","عِلْمٍ","هُدًى","وَرَحْمَةً","لِّقَوْمٍ","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"فَصَّلَ"}},{"id":"fassala-10-5-19","words":["verb:fassala"],"options":[{"bs":"objašnjava potanko","en":"he/it explains in detail"},{"bs":"potanko smo izložili","en":"We have detailed"},{"bs":"i objašnjavamo potanko","en":"and we explain in detail"},{"bs":"objasnio je potanko","en":"he/it explained in detail"}],"ref":"10:5","answerWord":"يُفَصِّلُ","answerSound":"audio/6c8f7f3bde93d31dfef6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who appointed the sun a splendour and the moon a light, and measured for her stages, that ye might know the number of the years, and the reckoning. Allah created not (all) that save in truth. He detaileth the revelations for people who have knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potanko objasniti","en":"to explain in detail"},"passage":["هُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","جَعَلَ","ٱلشَّمْسَ","ضِيَآءً","وَٱلْقَمَرَ","نُورًا","وَقَدَّرَهُۥ","مَنَازِلَ","لِتَعْلَمُوا۟","عَدَدَ","ٱلسِّنِينَ","وَٱلْحِسَابَ","مَا","خَلَقَ","ٱللَّهُ","ذَٰلِكَ","إِلَّا","بِٱلْحَقِّ","يُفَصِّلُ","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","لِقَوْمٍ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"فَصَّلَ"}},{"id":"fassala-6-119-10","words":["verb:fassala"],"options":[{"bs":"objasnio je potanko","en":"he/it explained in detail"},{"bs":"i objašnjavamo potanko","en":"and we explain in detail"},{"bs":"objasnili smo ga potanko","en":"we explained it in detail"},{"bs":"potanko smo izložili","en":"We have detailed"}],"ref":"6:119","answerWord":"فَصَّلَ","answerSound":"audio/beabce0dec95eb436d35.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How should ye not eat of that over which the name of Allah hath been mentioned, when He hath explained unto you that which is forbidden unto you unless ye are compelled thereto. But lo! many are led astray by their own lusts through ignorance. Lo! thy Lord, He is Best Aware of the transgressors.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potanko objasniti","en":"to explain in detail"},"passage":["وَمَا","لَكُمْ","أَلَّا","تَأْكُلُوا۟","مِمَّا","ذُكِرَ","ٱسْمُ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَيْهِ","وَقَدْ","فَصَّلَ","لَكُم","مَّا","حَرَّمَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","إِلَّا","مَا","ٱضْطُرِرْتُمْ","إِلَيْهِ","وَإِنَّ","كَثِيرًا","لَّيُضِلُّونَ","بِأَهْوَآئِهِم","بِغَيْرِ","عِلْمٍ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","هُوَ","أَعْلَمُ","بِٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"فَصَّلَ"}},{"id":"fassala-9-11-9","words":["verb:fassala"],"options":[{"bs":"i objašnjavamo potanko","en":"and we explain in detail"},{"bs":"objašnjeno je potanko","en":"it was explained in detail"},{"bs":"potanko smo izložili","en":"We have detailed"},{"bs":"objasnili smo ga potanko","en":"we explained it in detail"}],"ref":"9:11","answerWord":"وَنُفَصِّلُ","answerSound":"audio/bb20d1a89c633581e74f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But if they repent and establish worship and pay the poor-due, then are they your brethren in religion. We detail Our revelations for a people who have knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potanko objasniti","en":"to explain in detail"},"passage":["فَإِن","تَابُوا۟","وَأَقَامُوا۟","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَءَاتَوُا۟","ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","فَإِخْوَٰنُكُمْ","فِى","ٱلدِّينِ","وَنُفَصِّلُ","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","لِقَوْمٍ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"فَصَّلَ"}},{"id":"sakana-10-67-5","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"da se odmarate","en":"so that you (all) may rest"},{"bs":"i stanovali ste","en":"and you (all) dwelt"},{"bs":"da se odmaraju","en":"so that they may rest"},{"bs":"miruje","en":"dwells"}],"ref":"10:67","answerWord":"لِتَسْكُنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/ff360c93fb66a26ab8d1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who hath appointed for you the night that ye should rest therein and the day giving sight. Lo! herein verily are portents for a folk that heed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["هُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","جَعَلَ","لَكُمُ","ٱلَّيْلَ","لِتَسْكُنُوا۟","فِيهِ","وَٱلنَّهَارَ","مُبْصِرًا","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَءَايَٰتٍ","لِّقَوْمٍ","يَسْمَعُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"sakana-2-35-2","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"stanuj!","en":"dwell!"},{"bs":"miruje","en":"dwells"},{"bs":"da se odmarate","en":"so that you (all) may rest"},{"bs":"i stanovali ste","en":"and you (all) dwelt"}],"ref":"2:35","answerWord":"ٱسْكُنْ","answerSound":"audio/4f928addf2aff84d4136.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We said: O Adam! Dwell thou and thy wife in the Garden, and eat ye freely (of the fruits) thereof where ye will; but come not nigh this tree lest ye become wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["وَقُلْنَا","يَٰٓـَٔادَمُ","ٱسْكُنْ","أَنتَ","وَزَوْجُكَ","ٱلْجَنَّةَ","وَكُلَا","مِنْهَا","رَغَدًا","حَيْثُ","شِئْتُمَا","وَلَا","تَقْرَبَا","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلشَّجَرَةَ","فَتَكُونَا","مِنَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"sakana-7-161-3","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"stanujte!","en":"(you all) dwell!"},{"bs":"stanuj!","en":"dwell!"},{"bs":"da se smiri","en":"so that he/it may find rest"},{"bs":"da se odmarate","en":"so that you (all) may rest"}],"ref":"7:161","answerWord":"ٱسْكُنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/16756d9f642e5dcec57f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it was said unto them: Dwell in this township and eat therefrom whence ye will, and say \"Repentance,\" and enter the gate prostrate; We shall forgive you your sins; We shall increase (reward) for the right-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قِيلَ","لَهُمُ","ٱسْكُنُوا۟","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلْقَرْيَةَ","وَكُلُوا۟","مِنْهَا","حَيْثُ","شِئْتُمْ","وَقُولُوا۟","حِطَّةٌ","وَٱدْخُلُوا۟","ٱلْبَابَ","سُجَّدًا","نَّغْفِرْ","لَكُمْ","خَطِيٓـَٰٔتِكُمْ","سَنَزِيدُ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"sakana-6-13-2","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"miruje","en":"dwells"},{"bs":"da se odmaraju","en":"so that they may rest"},{"bs":"stanuj!","en":"dwell!"},{"bs":"odmarate se","en":"you (all) rest"}],"ref":"6:13","answerWord":"سَكَنَ","answerSound":"audio/bee3af43ad9112f31ffa.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Unto Him belongeth whatsoever resteth in the night and the day. He is the Hearer, the Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["وَلَهُۥ","مَا","سَكَنَ","فِى","ٱلَّيْلِ","وَٱلنَّهَارِ","وَهُوَ","ٱلسَّمِيعُ","ٱلْعَلِيمُ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"sakana-7-189-9","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"da se smiri","en":"so that he/it may find rest"},{"bs":"stanuj!","en":"dwell!"},{"bs":"miruje","en":"dwells"},{"bs":"da se odmarate","en":"so that you (all) may rest"}],"ref":"7:189","answerWord":"لِيَسْكُنَ","answerSound":"audio/343d4bdc0b14cc1389dd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who did create you from a single soul, and therefrom did make his mate that he might take rest in her. And when he covered her she bore a light burden, and she passed (unnoticed) with it, but when it became heavy they cried unto Allah, their Lord, saying: If thou givest unto us aright we shall be of the thankful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["هُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَكُم","مِّن","نَّفْسٍ","وَٰحِدَةٍ","وَجَعَلَ","مِنْهَا","زَوْجَهَا","لِيَسْكُنَ","إِلَيْهَا","فَلَمَّا","تَغَشَّىٰهَا","حَمَلَتْ","حَمْلًا","خَفِيفًا","فَمَرَّتْ","بِهِۦ","فَلَمَّآ","أَثْقَلَت","دَّعَوَا","ٱللَّهَ","رَبَّهُمَا","لَئِنْ","ءَاتَيْتَنَا","صَٰلِحًا","لَّنَكُونَنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلشَّٰكِرِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"sakana-14-45-0","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"i stanovali ste","en":"and you (all) dwelt"},{"bs":"da se smiri","en":"so that he/it may find rest"},{"bs":"miruje","en":"dwells"},{"bs":"stanuj!","en":"dwell!"}],"ref":"14:45","answerWord":"وَسَكَنتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/8af325ab1973ecd18c39.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (have ye not) dwelt in the dwellings of those who wronged themselves (of old) and (hath it not) become plain to you how We dealt with them and made examples for you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["وَسَكَنتُمْ","فِى","مَسَٰكِنِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","وَتَبَيَّنَ","لَكُمْ","كَيْفَ","فَعَلْنَا","بِهِمْ","وَضَرَبْنَا","لَكُمُ","ٱلْأَمْثَالَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"sakana-27-86-5","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"da se odmaraju","en":"so that they may rest"},{"bs":"stanovali ste","en":"you (all) dwelt"},{"bs":"da se smiri","en":"so that he/it may find rest"},{"bs":"da se odmarate","en":"so that you (all) may rest"}],"ref":"27:86","answerWord":"لِيَسْكُنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4f5c58569b49e2ec0d9a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have they not seen how We have appointed the night that they may rest therein, and the day sight-giving? Lo! therein verily are portents for a people who believe.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","يَرَوْا۟","أَنَّا","جَعَلْنَا","ٱلَّيْلَ","لِيَسْكُنُوا۟","فِيهِ","وَٱلنَّهَارَ","مُبْصِرًا","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَءَايَٰتٍ","لِّقَوْمٍ","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"sakana-28-72-17","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"odmarate se","en":"you (all) rest"},{"bs":"stanuj!","en":"dwell!"},{"bs":"miruje","en":"dwells"},{"bs":"i stanovali ste","en":"and you (all) dwelt"}],"ref":"28:72","answerWord":"تَسْكُنُونَ","answerSound":"audio/882538384d45636c6573.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Have ye thought, if Allah made day everlasting for you till the Day of Resurrection, who is a god beside Allah who could bring you night wherein ye rest? Will ye not then see?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَرَءَيْتُمْ","إِن","جَعَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلنَّهَارَ","سَرْمَدًا","إِلَىٰ","يَوْمِ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","مَنْ","إِلَٰهٌ","غَيْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","يَأْتِيكُم","بِلَيْلٍ","تَسْكُنُونَ","فِيهِ","أَفَلَا","تُبْصِرُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"sakana-30-21-8","words":["verb:sakana"],"options":[{"bs":"da se smirite","en":"so that you (all) may find rest"},{"bs":"da se odmaraju","en":"so that they may rest"},{"bs":"miruje","en":"dwells"},{"bs":"stanovali ste","en":"you (all) dwelt"}],"ref":"30:21","answerWord":"لِّتَسْكُنُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/290ee2eb9ff227bef10a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And of His signs is this: He created for you helpmeets from yourselves that ye might find rest in them, and He ordained between you love and mercy. Lo! herein indeed are portents for folk who reflect.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stanovati, smiriti se","en":"to dwell, to rest"},"passage":["وَمِنْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦٓ","أَنْ","خَلَقَ","لَكُم","مِّنْ","أَنفُسِكُمْ","أَزْوَٰجًا","لِّتَسْكُنُوٓا۟","إِلَيْهَا","وَجَعَلَ","بَيْنَكُم","مَّوَدَّةً","وَرَحْمَةً","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَءَايَٰتٍ","لِّقَوْمٍ","يَتَفَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"سَكَنَ"}},{"id":"salia-82-15-0","words":["verb:salia"],"options":[{"bs":"gorjet će u njemu","en":"they will burn in it"},{"bs":"gori","en":"he/it burns (in fire)"},{"bs":"i gorjet će","en":"and they will burn (in fire)"},{"bs":"gori u njoj","en":"he/it burns in it"}],"ref":"82:15","answerWord":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا","answerSound":"audio/54aedce211707ae53521.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will burn therein on the Day of Judgment,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"gorjeti (u vatri)","en":"to burn (in fire)"},"passage":["يَصْلَوْنَهَا","يَوْمَ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"صَلِيَ"}},{"id":"salia-36-64-0","words":["verb:salia"],"options":[{"bs":"gorite u njemu","en":"burn in it"},{"bs":"gori u njoj","en":"he/it burns in it"},{"bs":"gorjet će","en":"he/it will burn (in fire)"},{"bs":"gorjet će u njemu","en":"they will burn in it"}],"ref":"36:64","answerWord":"ٱصْلَوْهَا","answerSound":"audio/e5efb05a2608b549548e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Burn therein this day for that ye disbelieved.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"gorjeti (u vatri)","en":"to burn (in fire)"},"passage":["ٱصْلَوْهَا","ٱلْيَوْمَ","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَكْفُرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"صَلِيَ"}},{"id":"salia-4-10-11","words":["verb:salia"],"options":[{"bs":"i gorjet će","en":"and they will burn (in fire)"},{"bs":"i gori","en":"and he/it burns (in fire)"},{"bs":"gorite u njemu","en":"burn in it"},{"bs":"gorjet će u njemu","en":"they will burn in it"}],"ref":"4:10","answerWord":"وَسَيَصْلَوْنَ","answerSound":"audio/d7bac9d91ff82ecff89a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Those who devour the wealth of orphans wrongfully, they do but swallow fire into their bellies, and they will be exposed to burning flame.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"gorjeti (u vatri)","en":"to burn (in fire)"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَأْكُلُونَ","أَمْوَٰلَ","ٱلْيَتَٰمَىٰ","ظُلْمًا","إِنَّمَا","يَأْكُلُونَ","فِى","بُطُونِهِمْ","نَارًا","وَسَيَصْلَوْنَ","سَعِيرًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"صَلِيَ"}},{"id":"salia-17-18-15","words":["verb:salia"],"options":[{"bs":"gori u njemu","en":"he/it burns in it"},{"bs":"gorjet će u njemu","en":"they will burn in it"},{"bs":"gori","en":"he/it burns (in fire)"},{"bs":"i gorjet će","en":"and they will burn (in fire)"}],"ref":"17:18","answerWord":"يَصْلَىٰهَا","answerSound":"audio/ecfec60d28c1563f0a9a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso desireth that (life) which hasteneth away, We hasten for him therein what We will for whom We please. And afterward We have appointed for him hell; he will endure the heat thereof, condemned, rejected.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"gorjeti (u vatri)","en":"to burn (in fire)"},"passage":["مَّن","كَانَ","يُرِيدُ","ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ","عَجَّلْنَا","لَهُۥ","فِيهَا","مَا","نَشَآءُ","لِمَن","نُّرِيدُ","ثُمَّ","جَعَلْنَا","لَهُۥ","جَهَنَّمَ","يَصْلَىٰهَا","مَذْمُومًا","مَّدْحُورًا"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"صَلِيَ"}},{"id":"salia-84-12-0","words":["verb:salia"],"options":[{"bs":"i gori","en":"and he/it burns (in fire)"},{"bs":"gorite u njemu","en":"burn in it"},{"bs":"gori u njoj","en":"he/it burns in it"},{"bs":"i gorjet će","en":"and they will burn (in fire)"}],"ref":"84:12","answerWord":"وَيَصْلَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/e26b1b5fb49a7d200284.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And be thrown to scorching fire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"gorjeti (u vatri)","en":"to burn (in fire)"},"passage":["وَيَصْلَىٰ","سَعِيرًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"صَلِيَ"}},{"id":"salia-87-12-1","words":["verb:salia"],"options":[{"bs":"gori","en":"he/it burns (in fire)"},{"bs":"i gorjet će","en":"and they will burn (in fire)"},{"bs":"gori u njoj","en":"he/it burns in it"},{"bs":"gorite u njemu","en":"burn in it"}],"ref":"87:12","answerWord":"يَصْلَى","answerSound":"audio/9e73da59c03492eb5086.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He who will be flung to the great Fire","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"gorjeti (u vatri)","en":"to burn (in fire)"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِى","يَصْلَى","ٱلنَّارَ","ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَلِيَ"}},{"id":"salia-92-15-1","words":["verb:salia"],"options":[{"bs":"gori u njoj","en":"he/it burns in it"},{"bs":"gorjet će u njemu","en":"they will burn in it"},{"bs":"gori","en":"he/it burns (in fire)"},{"bs":"gorite u njemu","en":"burn in it"}],"ref":"92:15","answerWord":"يَصْلَىٰهَآ","answerSound":"audio/ad77decc5ff300528e80.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Which only the most wretched must endure,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"gorjeti (u vatri)","en":"to burn (in fire)"},"passage":["لَا","يَصْلَىٰهَآ","إِلَّا","ٱلْأَشْقَى"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَلِيَ"}},{"id":"salia-111-3-0","words":["verb:salia"],"options":[{"bs":"gorjet će","en":"he/it will burn (in fire)"},{"bs":"gori u njoj","en":"he/it burns in it"},{"bs":"gorjet će u njemu","en":"they will burn in it"},{"bs":"i gorjet će","en":"and they will burn (in fire)"}],"ref":"111:3","answerWord":"سَيَصْلَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/e7f779c429101f6eb199.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He will be plunged in flaming Fire,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"gorjeti (u vatri)","en":"to burn (in fire)"},"passage":["سَيَصْلَىٰ","نَارًا","ذَاتَ","لَهَبٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"صَلِيَ"}},{"id":"yassara-54-17-1","words":["verb:yassara"],"options":[{"bs":"olakšali smo","en":"we made easy"},{"bs":"olakšali smo ga","en":"we made it easy"},{"bs":"i olakšavamo ti","en":"and we ease you"},{"bs":"pa ćemo mu olakšati","en":"so we will ease him"}],"ref":"54:17","answerWord":"يَسَّرْنَا","answerSound":"audio/3a1e094fc48647f0a155.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And in truth We have made the Qur'an easy to remember; but is there any that remembereth?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"olakšati","en":"to make easy, to ease"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","يَسَّرْنَا","ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","لِلذِّكْرِ","فَهَلْ","مِن","مُّدَّكِرٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"يَسَّرَ"}},{"id":"yassara-44-58-1","words":["verb:yassara"],"options":[{"bs":"olakšali smo ga","en":"we made it easy"},{"bs":"i olakšaj","en":"and ease"},{"bs":"i olakšavamo ti","en":"and we ease you"},{"bs":"olakšali smo","en":"we made easy"}],"ref":"44:58","answerWord":"يَسَّرْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/489178d49b9ca4f2036d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We have made (this Scripture) easy in thy language only that they may heed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"olakšati","en":"to make easy, to ease"},"passage":["فَإِنَّمَا","يَسَّرْنَٰهُ","بِلِسَانِكَ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَتَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"يَسَّرَ"}},{"id":"yassara-92-7-0","words":["verb:yassara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ćemo mu olakšati","en":"so we will ease him"},{"bs":"i olakšavamo ti","en":"and we ease you"},{"bs":"olakšali smo","en":"we made easy"},{"bs":"olakšali smo ga","en":"we made it easy"}],"ref":"92:7","answerWord":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/358af5c9e34fd0de5a10.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Surely We will ease his way unto the state of ease.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"olakšati","en":"to make easy, to ease"},"passage":["فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ","لِلْيُسْرَىٰ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"يَسَّرَ"}},{"id":"yassara-20-26-0","words":["verb:yassara"],"options":[{"bs":"i olakšaj","en":"and ease"},{"bs":"olakšali smo","en":"we made easy"},{"bs":"pa ćemo mu olakšati","en":"so we will ease him"},{"bs":"i olakšavamo ti","en":"and we ease you"}],"ref":"20:26","answerWord":"وَيَسِّرْ","answerSound":"audio/75e313e2f6a15a57e440.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And ease my task for me;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"olakšati","en":"to make easy, to ease"},"passage":["وَيَسِّرْ","لِىٓ","أَمْرِى"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"يَسَّرَ"}},{"id":"yassara-87-8-0","words":["verb:yassara"],"options":[{"bs":"i olakšavamo ti","en":"and we ease you"},{"bs":"olakšali smo ga","en":"we made it easy"},{"bs":"i olakšaj","en":"and ease"},{"bs":"pa ćemo mu olakšati","en":"so we will ease him"}],"ref":"87:8","answerWord":"وَنُيَسِّرُكَ","answerSound":"audio/577c0a24e8bc5a360828.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We shall ease thy way unto the state of ease.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"olakšati","en":"to make easy, to ease"},"passage":["وَنُيَسِّرُكَ","لِلْيُسْرَىٰ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"يَسَّرَ"}},{"id":"kaffa-4-84-13","words":["verb:kaffa"],"options":[{"bs":"zadržava","en":"he/it restrains"},{"bs":"pa je zadržao","en":"so he/it withheld"},{"bs":"zadržao sam","en":"I withheld"},{"bs":"zadržite!","en":"(you all) withhold!"}],"ref":"4:84","answerWord":"يَكُفَّ","answerSound":"audio/bb94f849c833be507a32.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So fight (O Muhammad) in the way of Allah Thou art not taxed (with the responsibility for anyone) except thyself - and urge on the believers. Peradventure Allah will restrain the might of those who disbelieve. Allah is stronger in might and stronger in inflicting punishment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"suzdržati se, prestati","en":"to refrain, to hold back"},"passage":["فَقَٰتِلْ","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","لَا","تُكَلَّفُ","إِلَّا","نَفْسَكَ","وَحَرِّضِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","عَسَى","ٱللَّهُ","أَن","يَكُفَّ","بَأْسَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","وَٱللَّهُ","أَشَدُّ","بَأْسًا","وَأَشَدُّ","تَنكِيلًا"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَّ"}},{"id":"kaffa-5-11-14","words":["verb:kaffa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je zadržao","en":"so he/it withheld"},{"bs":"i zadržavaju","en":"and they restrain"},{"bs":"zadržite!","en":"(you all) withhold!"},{"bs":"zadržao sam","en":"I withheld"}],"ref":"5:11","answerWord":"فَكَفَّ","answerSound":"audio/1b346a1fe212c3d4802f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Remember Allah's favour unto you, how a people were minded to stretch out their hands against you but He withheld their hands from you; and keep your duty to Allah. In Allah let believers put their trust.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"suzdržati se, prestati","en":"to refrain, to hold back"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ٱذْكُرُوا۟","نِعْمَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَيْكُمْ","إِذْ","هَمَّ","قَوْمٌ","أَن","يَبْسُطُوٓا۟","إِلَيْكُمْ","أَيْدِيَهُمْ","فَكَفَّ","أَيْدِيَهُمْ","عَنكُمْ","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَعَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَّ"}},{"id":"kaffa-21-39-6","words":["verb:kaffa"],"options":[{"bs":"zadržavaju","en":"they hold back"},{"bs":"zadržava","en":"he/it restrains"},{"bs":"zadržao sam","en":"I withheld"},{"bs":"pa je zadržao","en":"so he/it withheld"}],"ref":"21:39","answerWord":"يَكُفُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/46a215f58098ff85e75c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If those who disbelieved but knew the time when they will not be able to drive off the fire from their faces and from their backs, and they will not be helped!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"suzdržati se, prestati","en":"to refrain, to hold back"},"passage":["لَوْ","يَعْلَمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","حِينَ","لَا","يَكُفُّونَ","عَن","وُجُوهِهِمُ","ٱلنَّارَ","وَلَا","عَن","ظُهُورِهِمْ","وَلَا","هُمْ","يُنصَرُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَّ"}},{"id":"kaffa-48-20-8","words":["verb:kaffa"],"options":[{"bs":"i zadržao je","en":"and he/it withheld"},{"bs":"zadržao sam","en":"I withheld"},{"bs":"i zadržavaju","en":"and they restrain"},{"bs":"zadržava","en":"he/it restrains"}],"ref":"48:20","answerWord":"وَكَفَّ","answerSound":"audio/db4af92935940463d431.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah promiseth you much booty that ye will capture, and hath given you this in advance, and hath withheld men's hands from you, that it may be a token for the believers, and that He may guide you on a right path.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"suzdržati se, prestati","en":"to refrain, to hold back"},"passage":["وَعَدَكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مَغَانِمَ","كَثِيرَةً","تَأْخُذُونَهَا","فَعَجَّلَ","لَكُمْ","هَٰذِهِۦ","وَكَفَّ","أَيْدِىَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","عَنكُمْ","وَلِتَكُونَ","ءَايَةً","لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","وَيَهْدِيَكُمْ","صِرَٰطًا","مُّسْتَقِيمًا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَّ"}},{"id":"kaffa-48-24-2","words":["verb:kaffa"],"options":[{"bs":"zadržao je","en":"he/it withheld"},{"bs":"zadržava","en":"he/it restrains"},{"bs":"zadržite!","en":"(you all) withhold!"},{"bs":"i zadržavaju","en":"and they restrain"}],"ref":"48:24","answerWord":"كَفَّ","answerSound":"audio/a3082f94b741680a2dfc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He it is Who hath withheld men's hands from you, and hath withheld your hands from them, in the valley of Mecca, after He had made you victors over them. Allah is Seer of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"suzdržati se, prestati","en":"to refrain, to hold back"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","كَفَّ","أَيْدِيَهُمْ","عَنكُمْ","وَأَيْدِيَكُمْ","عَنْهُم","بِبَطْنِ","مَكَّةَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","أَنْ","أَظْفَرَكُمْ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","بَصِيرًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَّ"}}]